# Host build output must never enter the image. A Windows obj/ folder carries a
# project.assets.json full of C:\ paths, which makes the Linux restore inside the
# container fail with "Unable to find fallback package folder".
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
tests/
*.md
docker-compose.yml
